WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.926 --> 00:00:15.628
and Guanyin stood on the lotus platform above Red Boy's mountain.

2
00:00:16.949 --> 00:00:19.671
"Let's attack Red Boy now," said the monkey.

3
00:00:19.691 --> 00:00:23.693
"Wait, Wukong," said Guanyin, holding up a hand.

4
00:00:23.713 --> 00:00:27.876
"There's a lot of water in this vase—enough for an ocean.

5
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:31.881
I don't want any animals harmed when I pour it out."

6
00:00:32.862 --> 00:00:34.402
She recited a quick spell.

7
00:00:35.583 --> 00:00:38.004
A moment later the local spirit arrived.

8
00:00:38.024 --> 00:00:42.445
"Bodhisattva," said the spirit.

9
00:00:42.466 --> 00:00:44.366
"What can I do for you?"

10
00:00:45.807 --> 00:00:50.329
"I'm going to pour magic water around Red Boy's mountain," said Guanyin.

11
00:00:50.349 --> 00:00:55.131
"Please make sure all the animals are far, far away from the mountain."

12
00:00:55.151 --> 00:00:58.292
"Yes, Bodhisattva," said the spirit.

13
00:00:59.700 --> 00:01:01.361
spirit flew down to earth.

14
00:01:02.862 --> 00:01:04.664
Wukong watched the ground below.

15
00:01:05.904 --> 00:01:09.507
First he saw some small animals scurry out from under bushes.

16
00:01:10.688 --> 00:01:12.249
Birds flew from branches.

17
00:01:14.410 --> 00:01:19.033
Then tigers, bears, and other large animals stampeded down the mountainside.

18
00:01:19.974 --> 00:01:23.697
Soon there wasn't a single animal anywhere near the mountain.

19
00:01:23.717 --> 00:01:28.360
"Now I can pour the water out," said Guanyin.

20
00:01:28.968 --> 00:01:32.551
She tipped the vase, and rolling waves of water poured out.

21
00:01:33.872 --> 00:01:36.214
The waves washed down the slopes of the mountain.

22
00:01:37.395 --> 00:01:41.098
The water level rose higher and higher, forming an ocean.

23
00:01:42.139 --> 00:01:44.441
Only the top of the mountain was above water.

24
00:01:44.461 --> 00:01:50.366
"Wukong, go down there and get the demon to come out," said Guanyin.

25
00:01:51.567 --> 00:01:53.529
him, but don't defeat him.

26
00:01:54.209 --> 00:01:57.892
Instead, lead him up here to me."

27
00:01:57.992 --> 00:01:59.673
Wukong jumped down to the mountain.

28
00:02:01.713 --> 00:02:04.234
He pulled out his iron bar and swung it.

29
00:02:06.415 --> 00:02:08.255
The door to the cave exploded.

30
00:02:09.736 --> 00:02:12.636
Red Boy ran out of the cave, looking furious.

31
00:02:12.656 --> 00:02:16.017
"You smashed my front door!"

32
00:02:16.217 --> 00:02:16.858
he shouted.

33
00:02:16.878 --> 00:02:19.698
"That's right," said the monkey.

34
00:02:19.719 --> 00:02:22.899
"And I'll smash if you don't release my friends."

35
00:02:24.140 --> 00:02:27.486
"Ha!" Red Boy laughed and then punched himself in the nose.

36
00:02:30.167 --> 00:02:31.048
Nothing happened.

37
00:02:31.068 --> 00:02:33.929
"Why didn't my fire magic work?"

38
00:02:34.209 --> 00:02:34.930
asked the demon.

39
00:02:35.770 --> 00:02:38.932
Then he noticed the ocean surrounding his mountain.

40
00:02:40.573 --> 00:02:41.454
Wukong laughed.

41
00:02:42.674 --> 00:02:46.977
"That is magic water, brought here by the bodhisattva Guanyin.

42
00:02:47.777 --> 00:02:49.838
You can't make fire anywhere near it."

43
00:02:52.588 --> 00:02:55.230
"Aargh!" Red Boy stabbed at Wukong with his lance.

44
00:02:57.572 --> 00:02:59.834
The monkey blocked the lance with his iron bar.

45
00:03:02.096 --> 00:03:04.458
Red Boy grunted and stabbed again.

46
00:03:05.339 --> 00:03:09.643
Wukong swung his iron bar, nearly knocking the lance from Red Boy's hands.

47
00:03:10.904 --> 00:03:15.228
The two fought until Wukong, pretending to be scared, leaped into the air.

48
00:03:16.389 --> 00:03:17.070
Boy followed.

49
00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:20.516
Up into the sky they flew.

50
00:03:20.596 --> 00:03:23.078
Red Boy kept jabbing his lance at Wukong.

51
00:03:23.819 --> 00:03:25.700
The monkey blocked it with his iron bar.

52
00:03:26.881 --> 00:03:29.964
Wukong hurried toward Guanyin on the lotus platform.

53
00:03:30.684 --> 00:03:33.026
He flew fast and ducked behind her.

54
00:03:33.867 --> 00:03:36.509
When Red Boy saw the bodhisattva, he stopped.

55
00:03:37.970 --> 00:03:39.852
"What are you doing here, Bodhisattva?"

56
00:03:39.992 --> 00:03:40.672
he demanded.

57
00:03:42.474 --> 00:03:43.735
stared back at the demon.

58
00:03:44.175 --> 00:03:45.636
But she didn't say a word.

59
00:03:45.696 --> 00:03:48.739
"I asked why you're here!"

60
00:03:49.099 --> 00:03:49.940
shouted Red Boy.

61
00:03:51.100 --> 00:03:53.022
Again Guanyin didn't answer.

62
00:03:53.042 --> 00:03:55.984
"Did Wukong ask you to come here?"

63
00:03:56.245 --> 00:03:57.065
shouted the demon.

64
00:03:57.085 --> 00:03:59.007
"Why don't you speak?"

65
00:04:00.328 --> 00:04:02.850
continued to stare silently at Red Boy.

66
00:04:03.971 --> 00:04:05.513
The demon became furious.

67
00:04:07.554 --> 00:04:10.156
raised his lance and shot toward Guanyin.

68
00:04:11.197 --> 00:04:12.619
The bodhisattva vanished!

69
00:04:13.800 --> 00:04:15.621
Red Boy laughed.

70
00:04:15.901 --> 00:04:18.684
"I guess she was scared of me."

71
00:04:19.712 --> 00:04:21.673
looked at the empty lotus platform.

72
00:04:21.693 --> 00:04:24.295
"Wukong is a fool!

73
00:04:25.075 --> 00:04:28.417
He couldn't defeat my fire magic, so he asked Guanyin for help.

74
00:04:29.398 --> 00:04:30.218
what did she do?

75
00:04:30.979 --> 00:04:33.380
She ran away as soon as I raised my weapon.

76
00:04:34.481 --> 00:04:36.382
Now this Buddhist treasure is mine!"

77
00:04:39.183 --> 00:04:41.085
Red Boy sat down on the platform.

78
00:04:42.165 --> 00:04:46.688
Instantly the platform turned back into swords, which surrounded the demon.

79
00:04:47.757 --> 00:04:50.125
Sharp points stuck at him on all sides.

80
00:04:50.145 --> 00:04:51.930
"Oh no!"

81
00:04:52.191 --> 00:04:52.994
cried Red Boy.

82
00:04:53.014 --> 00:04:54.117
"I'm trapped!"
